Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:20:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] S3-7: cutscene vignettes over kept stills and puff stamps
 (GBA ROM), speed2 group cutscene

The home, fog, eruption and Vapula vignettes draw their still sky / wall / room as one kept
picture (backdrop families 4 and 5, baked by the native runner into backdrops.bin), and a puff
cloud is a stamp (one image) where it was 20 circles. Same pixels, frame for frame
(test_cutbk), but the sky's seam row (it was scene-entry garbage on the GBA) and the eruption's
cloud past 50 px, which is a kept picture that does not breathe. PS1: compiled out.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63cvyt9PpfrF57wBDFeR
